&lt;p&gt; &lt;a class="cta_button" href="https://www.hubspot.com/cs/ci/?pg=64493837-f4dd-43b0-abee-3ef154e06092&amp;amp;pid=53&amp;amp;ecid=&amp;amp;hseid=&amp;amp;hsic="&gt;&lt;img class="hs-cta-img " style="height: auto !important; width: auto !important; max-width: 100% !important;border-width: 0px; /*hs-extra-styles*/; margin: 0 auto; display: block; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px" alt="Connect HubSpot to Claude For Personalized Insights [Free Connector]" height="58" width="645" src="https://no-cache.hubspot.com/cta/default/53/64493837-f4dd-43b0-abee-3ef154e06092.png" align="middle"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;AI already plays a significant role in marketing tasks. &lt;a href="https://www.hubspot.com/state-of-marketing"&gt;HubSpot’s 2026 State of Marketing Report&lt;/a&gt; found that 80% of marketers use AI for content creation, while 67% say AI saves their teams at least 10 hours per week. The opportunity now is to use AI efficiency gains to create marketing work that remains useful, differentiated, and connected to business data.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;The strongest Claude options range from CRM connectors such as &lt;a href="https://www.hubspot.com/claude"&gt;HubSpot connector for Claude&lt;/a&gt; to Anthropic’s Marketing plugin, reusable brand skills, analytics tools, publishing connections, and Claude’s design capabilities.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;This guide compares the Claude marketing plugin options worth considering in 2026 and explains how marketers can choose, implement, and measure them.&lt;/p&gt; 
