&lt;a&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;Profound vs. Semrush AEO Engine and LLM Coverage&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;AEO tool selection depends on engine coverage, prompt intelligence, crawler analytics, workflows, pricing, and team fit. Engine coverage is the easiest place to start because the numbers are concrete, and a tool that tracks only one engine leaves you blind to the others.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Profound tiers its coverage. Starter tracks ChatGPT only, Growth tracks three engines (ChatGPT, Perplexity, an...

&lt;p&gt;The way people search for information is changing. Instead of scrolling through a list of blue links, more users are turning to AI-powered tools like ChatGPT, Google’s AI Overviews, and Perplexity that deliver direct answers to questions.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="cta_button" href="https://www.hubspot.com/cs/ci/?pg=9dd5e54b-fbef-4dd0-bc44-1689feb1ea18&amp;amp;pid=53&amp;amp;ecid=&amp;amp;hseid=&amp;amp;hsic="&gt;&lt;img class="hs-cta-img " style="height: auto !important; width: auto !important; max-width: 100% !important;border-width: 0px; /*hs-extra-styles*/; margin: 0 auto; display: block; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px" alt="Get Started with HubSpot's AEO Tool" height="58" width="335" src="https://no-cache.hubspot.com/cta/default/53/9dd5e54b-fbef-4dd0-bc44-1689feb1ea18.png" align="middle"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.hubspot.com/marketing/evolution-of-search"&gt;This shift has given rise to answer engine optimization&lt;/a&gt; (AEO), a discipline focused on optimizing content so it gets selected and surfaced by AI-driven answer engines rather than just ranked in traditional search results. AEO analysis helps teams understand where a brand currently stands in those answers and what to do about it.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;This guide covers what AEO is, how it works, why it matters, and how to implement an AEO strategy.&lt;/p&gt; 
