&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#what-is-aeo-analysis-and-how-is-it-different-from-seo"&gt;What is AEO analysis and how is it different from SEO?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#what-a-good-aeo-analysis-should-measure"&gt;What a Good AEO Analysis Should Measure&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
